  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes private beach access at The Bluffs with 2 sets of beach chairs and the Beach Better Box included (March 1 - October 31) . Additional beach service chairs can be rented through Jake's Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.<br><br>Welcome to your home away from home, Winston Manor!<br><br>Formerly known as 30 Love, Winston Manor is located in The Bluffs, a gulf-front luxury community located in Inlet Beach. With 350 ft of PRIVATE BEACH space, The Bluffs is one of the only communities on 30A that guarantees front row beach service for all our guests. Our home offers 5 bedrooms, 6.5 bathrooms, and wonderful accommodations for up to 12 guests. The breathtaking Emerald Coast water can be seen from each level of this magnificent home. <br><br>The home's classic white exterior paired with modern black-frame windows creates a fresh and inviting first impression. On the first floor, you'll find an outdoor patio area featuring a lounge area and a dining area complete with a large TV and ping-pong table for endless entertainment. For convenience, you'll find this home also has an outdoor shower to rise off sand, a half-bath, and a washer/dryer.<br><br>The second floor is home to three stunning guest bedrooms, two of which open onto the spacious deck offering breathtaking Gulf views. The deck is thoughtfully designed for relaxation, with a charming porch swing that invites you to sway gently while taking in the serene beauty of the water. The first bedroom boasts a luxurious king bed and a private bathroom with a spacious walk-in shower. The secondary master suite offers another king bed and a private bathroom with both a shower and a separate soaking tub for ultimate relaxation. The third bedroom on this level features two beautiful queen beds and a private bathroom with a shower/tub combination, providing both comfort and style for your guests. <br><br>The third floor offers the main living space and an open-concept floor plan adjoining the kitchen, dining, and living room areas. The gourmet kitchen features bright white cabinetry, beautiful marble counter tops, top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances, and an ice machine. The dining area offers seating for ten guests, with 5 additional seats at the nearby kitchen island. In the living room, plush furnishings and a soft, neutral décor palette create an inviting and relaxing ambiance. A wall of pocket sliding-glass doors allows abundant natural light to fill the third-floor main living space and leads to the third-floor deck. This outdoor oasis is perfect for gathering and entertaining with dining space for 8, and a grill for al fresco meals. Also on this level, you will find a charming bunk room equipped with a queen over queen bunk bed. This room shares a bathroom that includes a walk-in shower. Adjacent to the shared bathroom, you'll find a cozy media room, ideal for relaxing and spending quality time together as a family. <br><br>The fourth floor is dedicated to the exquisite master suite, which boasts shiplap walls and high, vaulted shiplap ceilings—perfect for amplifying the natural light from the French doors. A luxurious king bed and sitting area offer comfortable accommodations, and the private en-suite bathroom features a spa-like experience with an incredible soaking tub, a large marble vanity with dual sinks, and a glass-front steam shower. See the breathtaking coastal waters from the master suite's private deck complete with a cozy firepit and lounge space, the perfect place to watch each captivating sunrise and sunset.<br><br>Guests in this home can conveniently access three levels via the home's elevator (does not go up to the fourth-floor master). 350+ feet of private beach access is a few steps away, so you can spend a day with your toes in the sugar white sand. 2 sets of beach chairs and 2 umbrellas are provided during the high season for your convenience. We've added the Beach Better Box that comes restocked daily with 8 beach towels, a Yeti cooler, 8 water bottles and fresh ice. Enjoy exclusive access to Rosemary Beach Fitness Center & Racquet Club.<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>350 ft of private beach for The Bluffs of Inlet Beach<br>One house back from the beach <br>5 bedrooms/6.5 bathrooms including 2 master bedrooms<br>Private deck with stunning views from all 4 floors of the home<br>Outdoor oasis with dining, lounging, and entertainment.<br>Elevator goes up to the 3rd floor of the home<br>2 sets of beach chairs (March 1 - October 31)<br>Beach Better Box (March 1 - October 31)<br>Exclusive access to the Rosemary Beach Fitness Center and Racquet Club<br>Access to community pool (Heated Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Years, and March 1 - Easter)<br>Please note: This community prohibits beach tents, canopies, sunshades, or wind assisted shades that may look like a tent. A beach umbrella is permitted. <br><br>This home is under new ownership. As we strive to enhance our guests' experience, some furnishings may differ from the current pictures. <br><br>Please note, this home does not allow pets as the owner is highly allergic.<br><br>THIS PROPERTY REQUIRES A 7 NIGHT MINIMUM, SATURDAY TO SATURDAY, DURING SPRING BREAK, SUMMER, AND MAJOR HOLIDAYS.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Winston Manor - The Bluffs in Inlet Beach! GULF FRONT COMMUNITY POOL!"
        }
      ],
